{
 "scope": "The WEIGHTED codimension-m graph area formula, and the LOCAL coarea equality on one chart that it completes: every point where the differential is surjective has an open neighbourhood on which the codimension-m coarea equality holds. THIS IS NOT THE CODIMENSION-m REGULAR COAREA FORMULA: codimension-m weighted slice measurability and the countable patching are still missing. No hole migrated. The log-concave Cheeger-Buser line belongs to collaborator Wang Haocheng and was not touched.",
